<div class="hero-section py-5 service-page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center min-vh-50">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 52px); line-height: 1.15;">
          Real Estate Transaction Coordination &amp; Availability Engine
        </h1>
        <p class="lead fw-semibold mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(18px, 2.3vw, 22px); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 980px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
          InstaShowing Orchestration &amp; Offer Ledger
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0" style="font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 18px); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 980px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);">
          A centralized scheduling and offer ledger that acts as the system of record for the listing, optimized for fast field use with auditability and automation built in.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="inner-sections">
  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="heading-border heading-center heading-left mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">The Challenge</h2>
          <p class="large-para mb-3">
            The residential “showing to offer” loop is notoriously fragmented. Agents, sellers, and buyers coordinate across SMS, email, and calls, leading to missed feedback and opaque
            offer negotiations.
          </p>
          <p class="large-para mb-0">
            The goal was to build a centralized source of truth for the entire showing lifecycle while keeping the interface fast and simple enough for field use. That meant consolidating
            availability across stakeholders, reducing approval friction, and ensuring offers/attachments are handled with auditability instead of spreadsheets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4">
            <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Quick Stats</h3>
            <ul class="mb-0 ps-3 small" style="line-height: 1.8;">
              <li><strong>Integrations:</strong> RESO Web API + DocuSign</li>
              <li><strong>Comms:</strong> Twilio alerts</li>
              <li><strong>Security:</strong> AES 256 + audit logs + 2FA</li>
              <li><strong>Impact:</strong> Less coordination friction; stronger agent satisfaction</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">The Solution</h2>
        <p class="large-para mb-3">
          We engineered a centralized scheduling and offer ledger that acts as the operating system for the listing. The platform automates the handshake between showing requests and seller
          approvals, then tracks every offer in a tamper resistant digital ledger.
        </p>
        <p class="large-para mb-0">
          The result is a single workflow: showings move from request → approval → notifications automatically, feedback is collected consistently, and offers are stored, compared, and progressed
          with strict audit trails, reducing coordination noise and accelerating time to contract.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Technical Approach</h2>
        <ul class="service-page-list mb-0" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>Calendar universal sync:</strong> Multi provider sync (Google/Outlook/iCloud) to compute true availability in real time.</li>
          <li><strong>Event driven feedback loop:</strong> Automated showing to feedback transition (including geofenced triggers) to drive higher response rates.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Technical Details</h2>
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Architecture</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">React → Ruby on Rails → PostgreSQL</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Integrations</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">RESO Web API (MLS), DocuSign (offers), Twilio (SMS alerts).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">Security</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">AES 256 encryption for offer docs; SOC 2 aligned handling; strict audit logs for every offer view; 2FA for agents.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
            <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
              <h3 class="h6 text-uppercase text-muted mb-3">AI Features</h3>
              <p class="mb-0 small">Sentiment aggregator scans agent feedback and produces a “market sentiment report” highlighting recurring concerns.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-4 pb-3 d-inline-block">Results &amp; Impact</h2>
        <ul class="service-page-list mb-0" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8;">
          <li><strong>Less friction</strong> in the showing request lifecycle through a single workflow and clear approvals.</li>
          <li><strong>Faster offer to contract cycles</strong> through centralized offer management and consistent follow up.</li>
          <li><strong>Stronger agent satisfaction</strong> due to mobile first, fast workflows with auditability.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-3 pb-3 d-inline-block">Ready to build something similar?</h2>
        <p class="lead mb-4">We’ll design your scheduling + document workflows with auditability and safe automation baked in.</p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/ahmadkamran/new-meeting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-pill px-5 me-2 mb-2">
          Schedule a Technical Discovery Call
        </a>
        <%= link_to "View our Services", root_path(anchor: "services"), class: "btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg rounded-pill px-5 mb-2 ajax" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

